      "details": "<p><em>Semer\u1e33and</em>: The capital city of the province of\u00a0<em>M\u0101ver\u0101\u2019\u00fc\u2019n-nehr</em>.\u00a0One of the kings of \u1e24imyer launched a campaign and devastated that land, so it came to be called \u015eemer-kend, meaning <em data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"151\">\u201cthe ruin of \u015eemer.\u201d\u00a0</em>After some time, this name became\u00a0<em>Semer\u1e33and</em> (Samarqand) in Arabic.\u00a0Later, Alexander the Great rebuilt it.\u00a0During the time of Qutayba ibn Muslim, when it was conquered by the Islamic state, its walls were restored once again.\u00a0The circumference of its walls is seventy thousand cubits. (translated to English by the first creator of this name entry.)</p>\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-690f0d00-d3c4-8330-adb4-2a3ae3eb3199-21\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-22\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] thread-sm:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] thread-lg:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] thread-lg:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\